1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,165
Can you stretch like

2
00:00:02,165 --> 00:00:03,375
a sleepy kitten?

3
00:00:03,675 --> 00:00:04,732
Hi, friends!

4
00:00:04,732 --> 00:00:05,648
It's Mimi!

5
00:00:05,648 --> 00:00:08,255
Let's do my sleepy kitten stretch.

6
00:00:08,605 --> 00:00:09,976
Ready?

7
00:00:10,726 --> 00:00:13,403
Stretch your arms up, up, up!

8
00:00:13,753 --> 00:00:16,054
Reach for the stars!

9
00:00:19,954 --> 00:00:21,793
Now wiggle your nose,

10
00:00:21,793 --> 00:00:23,096
like a kitten.

11
00:00:23,446 --> 00:00:25,503
Wiggle, wiggle!

12
00:00:27,503 --> 00:00:29,321
Hoo! I'll try too.

13
00:00:29,321 --> 00:00:30,878
Wiggle, wiggle.

14
00:00:31,228 --> 00:00:34,003
Oops! My nose is a beak!

15
00:00:34,753 --> 00:00:35,513
Hee hee!

16
00:00:35,513 --> 00:00:36,549
Silly Ollie!

17
00:00:36,549 --> 00:00:39,311
You can wiggle your feathers instead!

18
00:00:40,061 --> 00:00:42,441
Wiggle, wiggle feathers!

19
00:00:42,441 --> 00:00:43,411
Hoo-hoo!

20
00:00:43,761 --> 00:00:45,961
Can you wiggle with us?

21
00:00:49,861 --> 00:00:51,262
Stretch up high,

22
00:00:51,262 --> 00:00:52,811
and touch the sky.

23
00:00:53,211 --> 00:00:54,711
Wiggle your nose,

24
00:00:54,711 --> 00:00:56,286
and curl up small.

25
00:00:56,686 --> 00:00:58,317
Now curl up small,

26
00:00:58,317 --> 00:01:00,491
and do a big kitten yawn.

27
00:01:00,841 --> 00:01:02,301
Aaah.

28
00:01:04,301 --> 00:01:05,301
Jingle!

29
00:01:05,801 --> 00:01:08,434
My little bell says goodnight!

30
00:01:08,784 --> 00:01:10,996
Goodnight, friends.

31
00:01:13,646 --> 00:01:15,453
Share with a friend and

32
00:01:15,453 --> 00:01:17,746
subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

33
00:01:18,346 --> 00:01:19,984
Watch the full story

34
00:01:19,984 --> 00:01:21,621
on Honey Bunny Kidz!
